Two products share one PVER:

| Layer | Purpose | Required? |
|-------|---------|-----------|
| Analyzer | Symbols, paths, CFG JSON | Yes for UI + agents |
| Explorer UI | Browse alarms / graphs | Optional |
| Agent triage | Classify one alarm (TP/FP/uncertain) | Optional |

